          "headline": "Ekholm's clearing attempt sealed it",
          "text": "Tampa Bay's third goal was credited to Nikita Kucherov, but his breakaway shot was trickling through Devon Levi when Mattias Ekholm knocked it in trying to clear it. \"That's my bad. I'll get Levs a nice dinner for that one,\" Ekholm told NHL.com.",
