            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "headline": "Edmonton outshot Tampa and still lost",
          "text": "The official game summary has Edmonton outshooting Tampa Bay 24-19, but the Oilers went 0-for-3 on the power play while Tampa scored on one of its two chances.",
